{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "59faf89ef0acce5d0e010a93ad8c4dab927ccc93cdb3502088d204e5bdc34c37", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n今回の衣装、なかなか面白いですね。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n这次的服装还挺有意思的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b008a3ba45717cab73b0f99c9dbc385848de660d520ffe7fd42bde07e596a760", "ja": "お、気に入ってくれたか？　事前に\n確認してはいたが、やっぱり律子に似合ってるよな。", "zh": "哦，喜欢这套吗？虽然之前\n确认过了，但果然很适合律子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "9de64075534a04082ed462be9825b3af2944fd1a23d2f7c88d37e5d783a7c627", "ja": "ふふっ、私をおだててもなにも出ませんよ。\nせいぜい、いつもより少しいい仕事をするぐらいで。", "zh": "呵呵，就算这样夸我，也不会有什么好处哦。\n顶多就是比平时工作得稍微好一点而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1003_p", "source_sha256": "afea17bff4ea4cc7d7e04791c1873007159d39c3ac4fd90bd9054d3f8f5ef395", "ja": "それなら、俺としては万々歳だよ。それなら、\nもっと褒めたら、もっといい仕事をしてくれるかな？", "zh": "那对我来说可就太好了。既然这样，\n要是再多夸几句，你是不是就能做得更好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "0e6b2c21cbe0bcace2314aa0d54626eac1d504217748d9a40d53dab5d6809264", "ja": "もう、からかわないでくださいよ……。\nそれより、この衣装、かなりパワフルな感じですね。", "zh": "真是的，请别拿我寻开心了……\n话说回来，这套服装感觉相当有力量感呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7fbffd89ec293c1d72930716b079874362cd69c8ee77ebd8ec1cec07b22a7400", "ja": "あぁ、パワフルかつラブリーな、愛と勇気のヒーロー！\n律子のイメージにピッタリだ。", "zh": "啊，既充满力量又可爱，是爱与勇气的英雄！\n和律子的形象太相称了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "1483e59506b5d24bd7b04e7d62a9faf257c11edc82255fd654e0536b2aa39700", "ja": "……なーんか、適当に言ってません？\nあ、やっぱり、褒め殺してもっと仕事させようと……。", "zh": "……总觉得，你是不是说得太随便了？\n啊，果然是想把我夸得飘飘然，好让我多干点活吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1007_p", "source_sha256": "56c242ba905b90f77d342c685a5914885ce36170d2cb4563be3bf4921b6bf7e9", "ja": "ち、違うよ！\nほんとにそう思ったから言っただけで……。", "zh": "不、不是的！\n我是真的这么想，所以才这么说的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "f5aa1968322aa1ee55578cfcd7555a69342dc803a4556476688b356859022345", "ja": "ふふっ、そういうことにしておきますよ。\nまあ私も、いわば同意見ですからね！", "zh": "呵呵，就当是这么回事吧。\n不过我也可以说是和你意见相同呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "fb4275b089cbb7c32bdd7bd5ed761daaf92ff15d3fe2304b598d871cafdcc79b", "ja": "……なんて、自分で言うのも照れちゃいますけど……\nこの衣装、結構私に合ってる気がして。", "zh": "……话是这么说，我自己说出来也挺不好意思的……\n不过我总觉得，这套服装还挺适合我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "647533a10c0789e21a7f9a60b68f9b09ccaaea729b159eed517a070d729a33a1", "ja": "すごく、気に入ってるんです。……たぶん、\n{$P$}が思っている以上に。", "zh": "我真的很喜欢这套服装。……大概，\n比{$P$}先生想象的还要喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1011_p", "source_sha256": "be69fd6e065e2a015bbdc7c1e46ac79bf19044bb85e7951831f9babd03c13773", "ja": "律子……。そうか。ありがとうな！", "zh": "律子……这样啊。谢谢你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "7559157c21c06a77180b3b5ca7a9d92bc24ac4b7a97606eea9d1bfb203d0a5c8", "ja": "も、もう。なにニヤニヤしてるんですか！\nまったく、せっかく人が真面目に感想を……。", "zh": "真是的，您、您干嘛笑得那么开心啊！\n真是的，人家难得认真地说感想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a07fc5871595c4f85140c336a895fc547ba0a42e4a398dd0774a4e1f66d095db", "ja": "ごめんごめん。でも、なんていうのかな。\nこうして言ってもらえると、やっぱり嬉しくて。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。不过，该怎么说呢……\n能听到你这么说，果然还是很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1014_p", "source_sha256": "81e8bd0212b5cdcf4baa498255747bcd1052c2416d082da45107410a80eb8680", "ja": "これでも、結構考えて仕事してるんだぞ、ははっ。\n律子からしたら、そうは見えないかもしれないけどな。", "zh": "我可是也经过不少思考才在工作的，哈哈。\n不过在律子看来，可能就不是那么回事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "fd32789bf7ccf073311ead410379caf13666a317dfa78754da0612aa645105ad", "ja": "別にそんなこと……。\nいつも一生懸命なことくらい、わかってますけど。", "zh": "也不是那回事……\n我当然知道你一直都很努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
