{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "12b9fbe9c3c180bead12fab8e96df484e1e7ba101a18ec0146a4ca607f02716e", "ja": "あー、いえ。とにかく、{$P$}殿。\n今度の仕事、期待しててくださいね。", "zh": "啊，没什么。总而言之，{$P$}殿下。\n下次的工作，你就好好期待吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_009rit0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_009rit0184_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "30667a842f854ed9852851ed080098c3404da27b5f80c7add0e48ef5591f50b7", "ja": "パワフルでラブリーな、愛と勇気のヒーローとして、\n大活躍してみせますから！　ふふっ！", "zh": "作为充满力量又可爱的爱与勇气的英雄，\n我一定会大显身手的！呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
